@startuml CU-17
actor "Cliente" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Angular (detalle de producto)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /recommendations" as Ctrl
entity "«Service» AIService / RecommenderService / EmbeddingService" as Svc
database "«Store» pgvector (product_embeddings + ivfflat)" as DB

participant "«Task» recompute_embeddings" as Task

Task -> Svc : 1: encode_batch(textos)
Svc -> DB : 2: UPSERT embedding
DB --> Task : 3: ok

Cli -> UI : 4: abre prenda X
UI -> Ctrl : 5: POST /recommendations/view/{variant_id}
Ctrl -> Svc : 6: log_view(client, variant)
Svc -> DB : 7: view_count++

Cli -> UI : 8: solicita recomendaciones
UI -> Ctrl : 9: GET /recommendations?source_variant_id=X
Ctrl -> Svc : 10: recommend_for_client(client, source, limit)
Svc -> Svc : 11: embedding de la variante/historial
Svc -> DB : 12: SELECT por similitud coseno
DB --> Svc : 13: variantes + score
Svc -> DB : 14: guardar recomendación
Ctrl --> UI : 15: RecommendationRead[]
UI --> Cli : 16: prendas similares con afinidad %

@enduml